    "chunk_text": "of a prudential regulator for Virtual Asset Service Providers. \u2022 Four Subcommittee meetings were already\n\nheld to discuss the way forward and for implementing the phased Action Plan.\n\n429 430\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d82\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dca \u0da2 \u0db1\u0dca\u0dad \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n2026 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dd2 09\n\nThank you.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Ravi Karunanayake, you can seek a short clarification on the Answer.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4 \u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe \u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Hon. Speaker, may I point out that it reflects how helpless the Minister becomes when he has to represent an independent institution such as the Central Bank and Hon. Minister, you are stymied in responding to the Questions that had been raised. My Question is directly related to a matter under the Magistrate's Court, where a Rs. 290 million fraud had been committed through cryptocurrency. Now, is this a trading facility or not?\n\nI asked a relevant question whether there is a tax evasion on that basis. If cryptocurrency is not accepted in the country, then it is illegal. If it is illegal, then a tax evasion takes place. So, how is it dealt with from there onwards? And, the Answer that was given, Sir, is a very clear sign that the stable door had been closed after the horse had bolted. Therefore, I would urge you all, as a Government, please take a decision as to how the Central Bank should respond to matters of this nature. There are three areas which basically make it illegal, and you were saying that they are conducting seminars."
