    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 (\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0d85\u0dba\u0dcf \u0dc3 \u0d9c\u0dba\u0dca\u0dad \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b85\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9c \u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha) Sir, this Question raised by the Hon. Ravi Karunanayake on 08.04.2026 also relates to currency and the Answer is as follows:\n\n431 432\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0dba\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\n\n5. Even though Banks engage in foreign exchange transactions with different categories of stakeholders, profits are not classified along such categories. Therefore, the Central Bank does not generate profits from handling foreign exchange transactions with the Government and does not engage in transactions with the public. 6. There are no restrictions for the international payment platforms to operate in Sri Lanka subject to the existing regulatory framework. As a result of the discussions held with relevant stakeholders, measures have been taken to operationalize PayPal service in Sri Lanka for the purpose of receiving export proceeds. Further, some banks are already providing fund receiving facilities through Wise. 7. Several Licensed Commercial Banks - LCBs - have partnered with international service providers similar to PayPal such as Wise and Payoneer to facilitate seamless inward remittances to Sri Lankan freelancers, start-ups and SMEs engaged in cross-border trade and services. 8. To introduce a prudential regulatory framework for Virtual Assets - VAs - and Virtual Asset Service Providers - VASPs - a Subcommittee, which was also referred to in the previous Answer as well, was established under the National Coordinating Committee on AML/CFT chaired by the Governor of the Central Bank. The Subcommittee on Virtual Asset Service Providers, which is led by the Deputy Minister of Digital Economy, consists of 33 members, representing a wide range of stakeholders."
