    "chunk_size_bytes": 1870,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0db1\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc7\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha, you may respond. \u0d9c\u0dd4 (\u0d86\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dca \u0da2\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc7\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b85\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9c\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha) Hon Deputy Speaker, Rs. 13.2 billion is the loss reported as to the records and the calculations available to the Central Bank. Hon. Member, as you said, if there is a difference in the report provided by Deloitte, we will take it into account. But, I did not get Deloitte's report.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc7\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) You were answering Parliament today.\n\nAnd coming back to the IRD issue, in fact, the estimation or any other action will have to be decided upon based on how this particular loss is going to be accounted for, whether it is going to be accounted for as an entire loss or whether the loss is going to be recovered. So, likewise, there may be some implications and that would be the reason why it cannot be reliably estimated. However, I am sure that the IRD, as you highlighted, would take all these actions in line with this and do the calculations. So, there is nothing to worry about.\n\nThe other point that you highlighted was about the STRs received by other banks. With reference to this particular NDB matter, even after making this particular disclosure, the Central Bank has not received any STRs. But, other STRs may have been received by other bank. However, if you could specifically mention the names of those banks and reports, we could request the Central Bank to get all those reports."
  },
  {
