    "chunk_text": "1. Dr. A.D.A. De Silva (Committee Chairman) Deputy Director General, Faculty of Teacher Education and Alternative Education, National Institute of Education.\n\n2. Prof. Fareena Ruzaik (Committee Deputy Chairman) Head, Department of Geography, Faculty of Arts, University of Colombo.\n\n4. Mr. K.K.P. Ariyasingha (Committee Member) Additional Secretary (Education Services Establishment), Ministry of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education. 5. Ms. H.M. Kumari (Committee Member) Additional Secretary (Religious Affairs), Ministry of Buddhasasana, Religious and Cultural Affairs. 6. Ms. Surangi Perera (Committee Member) Legal Officer, Legal Branch, Ministry of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education. 7. Mr. M.S.M. Nawas (Committee Member) Director, Department of Muslim Religious and Cultural Affairs, Colombo 10. 8. Ms. B.D. Wickramathilaka (Committee Member) Director of Education, Government Approved Private Schools Branch, Ministry Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education. 9. Ash-Sheikh M. Arkam Nooramith (Committee Member) General Secretary, All Ceylon Jamiyyathul Ulama. 10. Prof. M.S.M. Jalaldeen (Committee\n\nMember) Dean (Rtd.), Faculty of Islamic Studies and Arabic Language, South Eastern University of Sri Lanka, No.48/14, Dharmashala Mawatha, Obesekarapura, Rajagiriya. 11. Mr. M.U.M. Riswan (Committee\n\nMember) Attorney-at-Law, 334/1A, Bopetta, Gothatuwa. 12. Dr. M.L. Mubarak (Committee Member) Director, Dharul Huda Ladies College for Arabic and Islamic Studies, Maruthamunai. 13. Ms. M.H. Fathima Nuskiya (Committee Member) Lecturer, Department of Geography, Faculty of Arts and Culture, South Eastern University of Sri Lanka.\n\n(\u0dca) \u0d85\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dc5 \u0d9c\u0db1\u0dcf\u0d9c . \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d91\u0db8\u0dca.\u0d91\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0db1. \u0d8b\u0daf\u0dd4\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dbd\u0db6\u0dca\u0daf\u0dc0\u0db6\u0dca\u0daf \u0dd9\u0dc5\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b8e\u0bae\u0bcd.\u0b8e\u0bb8\u0bcd. \u0b89\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bb2\u0baa\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa) (The Hon. M.S. Uthumalebbe) \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bcc\u0bb0\u0bb5 \u0b85\u0b95\u0bae\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0b95\u0bb3, \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b86\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0bae\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0bb0\u0bb8\u0bbe\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0b95\u0bb3\u0baa\u0bcd \u0baa\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb5\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0b9a\u0baf\u0bcd\u0bb5\u0ba4\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbe\u0ba9 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0b9f \u0b95\u0b9f\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4 4 \u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0b9f \u0b95\u0bbe\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bbe\u0b95 \u0b87\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0b95\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0ba4\u0bc1. \u0b95\u0b9f\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4 \u0b85\u0bb0\u0b9a\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd\n\n1041 1042\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2 \u0d9c\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0"
