    "chunk_size_bytes": 2066,
    "chunk_text": "(i) whether rehabilitation centres have been established under the Provincial Ministry of Health of the Northern Province for the rehabilitation of individuals addicted to alcohol and drugs; (ii) if so, the districts in which the rehabilitation centres have been established; (iii) whether services are currently being rendered from the above centres; (iv) if so, the districts in which services are rendered; (v) if not, the reasons therefor; and (vi) the time frame within which these centers are expected to become functional?\n\n(b) If not, why?\n\n(a) (i) Yes.\n\nAlcohol rehabilitation services are being provided through health institutions under the Northern Provincial Ministry of Health. In addition, drug dependence treatment and rehabilitation services have been initiated at selected hospitals in the Northern Province under the National Dangerous Drugs\n\n1159 1160\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\n\nControl Board under the purview of Ministry of Public Security and Parliamentary Affairs.\n\n(ii) Alcohol rehabilitation centres are functioning at the following institutions under the Northern Provincial Health Services:\n\n\u2022 Divisional Hospital, Dharmapuram -\n\nKilinochchi District\n\n\u2022 Base Hospital, Chavakachcheri -\n\nJaffna District\n\nDrug dependence treatment and rehabilitation services under the National Dangerous Drugs Control Board have been established or are being developed at:\n\n\u2022 Divisional Hospital, Oddusuddan -\n\nMullaitivu District\n\n\u2022 Divisional Hospital, Gurunagar - Jaffna District\n\n(iii) Yes.\n\nAlcohol rehabilitation services are currently being provided at:\n\n\u2022 Divisional Hospital, Dharmapuram\n\n\u2022 Base Hospital, Chavakachcheri\n\nDrug-dependence treatment and rehabilitation services have also commenced at the Divisional Hospital Oddusuddan under the National Dangerous Drugs Control Board. The proposed centre at Divisional Hospital Gurunagar is not yet operational, as renovation and infrastructure improvement works are currently in progress.\n\n(iv) Services are currently being provided in the following districts:"
  },
