    "chunk_size_bytes": 2103,
    "chunk_text": "Drug-dependence treatment and rehabilitation services have also commenced at the Divisional Hospital Oddusuddan under the National Dangerous Drugs Control Board. The proposed centre at Divisional Hospital Gurunagar is not yet operational, as renovation and infrastructure improvement works are currently in progress.\n\n(iv) Services are currently being provided in the following districts:\n\nKilinochchi - Alcohol rehabilitation District services at Divisional Hospital, Dharmapuram. Mullaitivu - Drug dependence treatment District and rehabilitation services at Divisional Hospital Oddusuddan under the National Dangerous Drugs Control Board.\n\n(v) Does not arise.\n\n(vi) The drug dependence treatment and rehabilitation centre at Divisional Hospital Gurunagar is expected to become operational following the completion of the ongoing renovation works and the provision\n\nof necessary facilities by the National Dangerous Drugs Control Board.\n\nThe exact date of commencement will be determined by the National Dangerous Drugs Control Board, which comes under the purview of the Ministry of Public Security and Parliamentary Affairs, based on the progress and completion of the renovation and other preparatory works.\n\n(b) Does not arise.\n\nI hope I clarified your queries, Hon. Member, but unfortunately, I am unable to provide any further answers on behalf of the Ministry. However, I would be happy to provide any further clarifications, if you reach out to me personally, getting down information from the Ministry.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab (\u0dc0\u0dc0\u0daf\u200d) \u0db4\u0dca \u0db8\u0db1\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dca \u0dca\u0dad\u200d\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dcf\u0d82\u0d9c\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bb5\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baf\u0bb0\u0bcd) \u0baa\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0bae\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0baf\u0bb2\u0bbf\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. (Dr.) Pathmanathan Sathiyalingam) Thank you very much. Tomorrow, there is a Meeting of that Ministerial Consultative Committee. So, I will raise my questions with the Hon. Minister and get them clarified. Again, thank you so much for the Answer.\n\n\u0dca\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dbd\u0dca \u0dca\u0dc4\u0dc3 \u0d85\u0d9a\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u200d\u0dc0\u0dc1\u0dba\u0dd3\u0dba\u200d \u0d86\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dc3 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u200d \u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbd"
  },
