    "md5": "6df8b34db9412e145f1913169b0d8c90",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2107,
    "chunk_text": "(h) The detailed information is given in Annex 01. In summary, the proposed investment committed for five years is US Dollars 2.1 billion. With regard to employment generation, the proposed manpower requirement for Year One is 14,335 and the number of employment opportunities created as of December, 2025 is, 9,871. There are 176 companies under four categories: 03 duty-free shops, 09 primary BSIs, 101 secondary BSIs and 63 Aps under those categories. I table* this particular list as the Annex.\n\n(i) The Colombo Port City presents a unique\n\nTo realize this vision, the Colombo Port City Economic Commission is developing the Colombo Port City as a world-class special economic zone and a regional hub, connecting the South Asia, the East Asia, the Middle East, Africa and Europe. Through a transparent and efficient Single-window framework, investors are able to establish and operate businesses with reduced bureaucratic obstacles and greater regulatory certainty.\n\nThe Commission, together with the Government, has undertaken several key initiatives, including,\n\n\u2022 establishing a clearer licensing and inventive framework;\n\n\u2022 enhancing transparency, efficiency and regulatory certainty;\n\n\u2022 strengthening investor facilitation through a true Single-window approach; and\n\n\u2022 promoting the Colombo Port City as a competitive platform for international investment and regional operations.\n\nThe Colombo Port City is being actively promoted to investors from China, India, Japan, Korea, the Middle East, Australia, the\n\n1183 1184\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9a\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\n\nUnited Kingdom, Europe, the United States and other global markets, leveraging Sri Lanka\u2019s strategic location at the centre of the Indian Ocean and along one of the world\u2019s busiest maritime trade routes. This location provides access to a market of over two billion people within relatively a short flying distance."
  },
