    "chunk_size_bytes": 1622,
    "chunk_text": "So, Hon. Minister, I am flagging this particular question entirely from an investor\u2019s perspective because I would like to see investments growing. But, my concern is, there seems to be a contradictory statement in your Answer given to Parliament. So, I would greatly appreciate it if you would kindly have this rechecked because with what is going on now, you could subsequently, in two, three years, have the investment approach completely changed, saying this was not the interpretation of the Supreme Court.\n\nThat is why I asked question (i), in order to get information on investments coming in from the USA, India, being the closest to us, the European Union, Japan and all of them. Investments coming in from them would be what is expected by the Sri Lankans as a pro-growth approach to develop Sri Lanka. So, Hon. Minister, please do not give me an answer just to satisfy the Question I asked under Standing Order No. 27(2). Look at the legality of this because it would certainly be questionable, if it is not properly looked into.\n\n1185 1186\n\n[\u0dba\u0dbb\u0dd4 (\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbd\u0dca \u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0dc4\u0dd2\u0dcf]\n\n2026 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 23\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab (\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dca \u0da2\u0dba\u0dca\u0dad \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b85\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9c\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha) Hon. Member, as of now, the objective of the Colombo Port City, of course, is to create it as an investment hub. It is mainly governed by the rules-based decisions and the entire purpose is to create a conducive environment for investments with ease of doing business."
  },
