    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab (\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dca \u0da2\u0dba\u0dca\u0dad \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b85\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9c\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha) Hon. Member, as of now, the objective of the Colombo Port City, of course, is to create it as an investment hub. It is mainly governed by the rules-based decisions and the entire purpose is to create a conducive environment for investments with ease of doing business.\n\nThen, as to why the Port City has not attracted investments so far, I would like to say that some things are gradually being amended and facilitations would be made in due course. There is a slow growth, as of now. But, I am happy to announce that already 176 companies have either commenced businesses or have agreed to invest and we need to follow them up. That is how there have been investments in addition to the initial investment of US Dollars 2.1 billion. Among them, there are primary strategic business investments and secondary strategic business investments, within which other authorized persons would carry out businesses. However, we will look into other areas for promoting investment opportunities. - [Interruption]\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u200d \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Hon. Ravi Karunanayake, you can have a very short verification."
  },
