    "chunk_text": "(ii) As of now, the percentage of electrified\n\nhouseholds is close to 100 per cent. Due to frequent new electricity connection requests, achieving the 100 per cent target is impracticable.\n\n(iii) Please refer to Table 2 below:\n\n(iv) Electricity connections have been provided\n\nto almost every household that requested. In the event of new requests, connections are provided accordingly.\n\n(b) (i) Please refer to Table 3 below:\n\nTable 3: Number of new domestic connections provided during the past five years.\n\n(ii) As of now, 110,582 consumers have\n\nregistered for SMS notifications. This represents approximately 96 per cent of the total consumers in the Vavuniya area.\n\n(c) (i) The institutions under this Ministry will\n\nimplement electricity service enhancements to improve electricity services in those districts, utilizing their own funds.\n\n(ii) Programmes to expand electricity connections in the rural and remote areas of those districts are being executed by this Ministry.\n\n(d) Not applicable.\n\nProvince Area Domestic\n\nNP Jaffna 131,213\n\nJaffna East 56,354\n\nKilinochchi 79,426\n\nVavuniya 92,774\n\nArea 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025\n\nVavuniya 3,296 1,998 989 1,104 547\n\n\"\u0da2\u0dba \u0d89\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\" \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0da9\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dc4\u0db1: \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dbb \"\u0b9c\u0baf \u0b87\u0b9a\u0bc1\u0bb0\" \u0ba8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb4\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bae\u0bcd: \u0bb5\u0bbf\u0baa\u0bb0\u0bae\u0bcd\n\n\u201cJAYA ISURA\u201d PROGRAMME: DETAILS\n\n2117/2026 3. \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf\n\n(\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) \u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) \u0db8\u0dd4